id=nad_hwcodec_fix
name=Nusantara HW video decode fix
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=holman
description=Restores MIUI's own MediaTek video decoder (libMtkOmxVdecEx.so + mtk_omx_core.cfg). The ROM's /product/vendor_overlay ships V4L2 decoders for other chips (MT6768/MT6779) that this kernel (legacy /dev/Vcodec, no V4L2) cannot run, so apps had no hardware video decoding.
